- Cover the full topic landscape WITHOUT venturing into unrelated territory

Tag rules:
- 1 to 3 words each
- Lowercase only
- No punctuation, hyphens, underscores, duplicates
- Common English dictionary words
- No participant names, greetings, pronouns, or filler

